{
  "schemaVersion": "cut1-project-facts-v1",
  "policyVersion": "cut1-atomic-grounding-v1",
  "acceptedRevision": "a868137fab607ae75d4b272301e9fc52b898e15c",
  "sources": [
    {
      "sourceId": "src_readme",
      "locatorType": "repository",
      "locator": "README.md",
      "revision": "a868137fab607ae75d4b272301e9fc52b898e15c",
      "byteCount": 3433,
      "sha256": "b029fd232dd4e6b5a92024356b6f193283fe39225991921d2a6f27f29ad652f2",
      "spans": [
        {
          "spanId": "src_readme_span_01",
          "byteStart": 16,
          "byteEnd": 377,
          "byteCount": 361,
          "sha256": "3e3236611435a19a3c6f09879e2ed70927036d317b5c8bd6ac91b4c665debd5e",
          "text": "**NarraTwin AI** is a provider-agnostic multilingual AI avatar walkthrough platform.\n\nNarraTwin turns approved knowledge into grounded, cited, multilingual avatar\nexplanations and interactive Q&A. It adapts explanations for legitimate product\naudiences including recruiters, hiring managers, engineers, product leaders,\ncustomers, beginners, and global viewers."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_readme_span_02",
          "byteStart": 408,
          "byteEnd": 587,
          "byteCount": 179,
          "sha256": "ff28378aa2092ceadf47ebb0dc161af2cf3bcad2e4af13819a434c79df3ed904",
          "text": "Interactive avatar Q&A remains intended and is not currently implemented.\nCurrent executable behavior is described below and must not be inferred from the\nproduct statement alone."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_readme_span_03",
          "byteStart": 1382,
          "byteEnd": 1670,
          "byteCount": 288,
          "sha256": "b5ceff26ec748a067b6d1360eeb41ca6ab47dfcaeab5678080a1a9b6e5fd9ccc",
          "text": "The implemented local/mock Phase 1 path covers:\n\n- project creation\n- markdown/text knowledge upload\n- ingest, chunk, and project-scoped retrieval\n- grounded walkthrough script generation\n- citation/source-reference display\n- unsupported-claim evaluation\n- stored output display in the UI"
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_readme_span_04",
          "byteStart": 2541,
          "byteEnd": 2606,
          "byteCount": 65,
          "sha256": "a3960b1d501810a7ce9fcd225f3f4751b4a443b2f3ee9a7e5442834020003689",
          "text": "Premium providers must not be hardcoded into core business logic."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_readme_span_05",
          "byteStart": 2279,
          "byteEnd": 2315,
          "byteCount": 36,
          "sha256": "5f26db39b2f0b5b01b8510ba183c8f01f80a0d9da118437906500618c5034cf9",
          "text": "- FastAPI backend\n- Next.js frontend"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src_brief",
      "locatorType": "repository",
      "locator": "docs/AI_BUILD_BRIEF.md",
      "revision": "a868137fab607ae75d4b272301e9fc52b898e15c",
      "byteCount": 6417,
      "sha256": "9ecf725ce4d90094af173ddc42fedc5894f6f23b68b2996b4e59a475c34c5b6e",
      "spans": [
        {
          "spanId": "src_brief_span_01",
          "byteStart": 724,
          "byteEnd": 958,
          "byteCount": 234,
          "sha256": "2b080f5497c036b4a9d05de5cc3abd7c603d0de196cccd9120794c7e89d917ca",
          "text": "English demo video or demo script\n→ transcription / script cleanup\n→ audience-specific script generation\n→ translation / localization\n→ voiceover generation\n→ avatar or video rendering\n→ subtitles\n→ export/shareable demo"
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_brief_span_02",
          "byteStart": 2039,
          "byteEnd": 2436,
          "byteCount": 397,
          "sha256": "c8291eae4c22c11fe08713af3c9b822e7a55f9ca13c87a95b103b724a93d909f",
          "text": "The product must support:\n\n- multilingual walkthroughs\n- audience-aware explanations\n- project-specific RAG\n- script generation\n- translation/localization\n- subtitles\n- text-to-speech\n- avatar video generation\n- interactive Q&A\n- free engineering mode\n- optional premium provider mode\n- provider-agnostic architecture\n- AI evaluation\n- observability\n- cost tracking\n- security and privacy controls"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src_pack",
      "locatorType": "repository",
      "locator": "docs/PROJECT_AVATAR_PACK.md",
      "revision": "a868137fab607ae75d4b272301e9fc52b898e15c",
      "byteCount": 4205,
      "sha256": "688e1115164084c1c7e4bf65498fbeb669cd2ecc582c6022d59c08a9e085edf5",
      "spans": [
        {
          "spanId": "src_pack_span_01",
          "byteStart": 44,
          "byteEnd": 400,
          "byteCount": 356,
          "sha256": "dd759bafccc2d8b540d8797c2b0f720cdfb5fda2577e10bdfaa380178654f642",
          "text": "The project-avatar-pack is the reusable source-of-truth folder that lets NarraTwin AI explain any project consistently across languages, audiences, depths, and output modes.\n\nThe pack prevents the avatar from inventing claims. It gives the system approved project knowledge for grounded script generation, future video creation, and future interactive Q&A."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_pack_span_02",
          "byteStart": 1019,
          "byteEnd": 1716,
          "byteCount": 697,
          "sha256": "c14afd04561c15f7836f941ccb6ded0e1d79c90acd333eed229f796284d01b40",
          "text": "| `project-summary.md` | What the project is, who it helps, and why it exists. |\n| `architecture.md` | Components, data flow, provider boundaries, deployment assumptions, and trade-offs. |\n| `business-impact.md` | Problem solved, measurable value, user benefit, and business relevance. |\n| `demo-script.md` | Existing English demo narration or walkthrough script. |\n| `recruiter-pitch.md` | Short career/recruiter-focused explanation of the project. |\n| `technical-deep-dive.md` | Engineering details for developers and technical reviewers. |\n| `faqs.md` | Approved answers to likely questions. |\n| `metrics.md` | Approved claims, metrics, outcomes, latency/cost numbers, and quality indicators. |"
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_pack_span_03",
          "byteStart": 2029,
          "byteEnd": 2357,
          "byteCount": 328,
          "sha256": "4b9cea763f11866399def13e2144c02e526a26a8c0eb241fa29dc1751211f78e",
          "text": "- Generated walkthroughs must only claim facts supported by approved pack content.\n- If a requested answer is not present in the pack, the system must say the information is unavailable in the approved project context.\n- Store context references with every generated output.\n- Record unsupported claims in the evaluation result."
        },
        {
          "spanId": "src_pack_span_04",
          "byteStart": 2682,
          "byteEnd": 2881,
          "byteCount": 199,
          "sha256": "e7140114f1cd0734f7348147f0e39016ad068ce24a3e42232813587fadbb6fb6",
          "text": "| Engineer | Architecture, APIs, RAG flow, evaluation, security, observability, testing, and failure handling. |\n| Product Leader | Problem, user value, differentiation, roadmap, and adoption path. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src_status",
      "locatorType": "repository",
      "locator": "docs/STATUS.md",
      "revision": "a868137fab607ae75d4b272301e9fc52b898e15c",
